title: 'Snowbridge: support the CallContracts command for atomic multi-contract calls'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Adds support for the new `CallContracts` Gateway command (companion to Snowfork/snowbridge#1702),
    which executes multiple Ethereum contract calls atomically: the sub-calls run in order and the
    whole command reverts on the first failure.

    On the outbound path this introduces a `ContractCall::V2 { calls, gas }` payload variant for
    `XCM::Transact`, a matching `Command::CallContracts` variant (kind `6`, ABI-encoded as
    `CallContractsParams`), and the converter pattern that maps the former to the latter.
crates:
- name: snowbridge-outbound-queue-primitives
  bump: minor
